      "source": "FY25/26 annexure (in force since 1 July 2020). The FY25/26 tariff schedule in the same document is stated to be 'exclusive of the 6c/kWh Network Surcharge, 2% Surcharge on Business and Large Power Users and VAT'.",
      "status": "IN_FORCE__CONFIRMED_AGAINST_LANDLORD_BILL",
      "default_apply": true,
      "basis": "all_tariff_charges",
      "note": "Confirmed against a real business-tariff bill: every Metronomic reading return for unit F112 carries 'JHB E LVD NON-TOU BUSINESS SURCH Basic @ R0.0200' levied on the energy + demand + reactive + service + network lines, with the 6c/kWh network surcharge excluded from the base. The FY26/27 City Power schedule does not restate the surcharge, but it remains in force.",
      "basis_definition": "Sum of the ROUNDED line items for energy, demand, reactive energy, service charge and capacity (network) charge. EXCLUDES the 6c/kWh network surcharge, any landlord/generation or other non-municipal charges, and VAT. Applied BEFORE the network surcharge is added."
    }
